    <h1>Public University Police Department</h1>
    <p>For campus police departments at Nebraska public universities that operate or access ALPR systems, including integration with parking enforcement.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container">
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Records sought</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>All current and superseded ALPR/LPR policies, standard operating procedures, privacy policies, retention schedules, training materials, and audit procedures governing campus police or university parking enforcement use of ALPR systems.</li>
      <li>All contracts, subscription agreements, purchase orders, amendments, renewals, invoices, payment records, and vendor correspondence concerning ALPR/LPR equipment or services used by the university police department or parking division.</li>
      <li>Current and historical inventory of all ALPR/LPR equipment used by the department or parking division, including vendor, model, asset identifier, fixed or mobile designation, assigned vehicle or installation location, and installation, removal, or replacement dates.</li>
      <li>All records concerning integration between the university's ALPR/LPR system and parking permit enforcement, including system access rights, data flows, and vendor agreements.</li>
      <li>All memoranda of understanding, data-sharing agreements, access agreements, and interagency correspondence involving ALPR/LPR information shared with or received from local, county, or state law enforcement agencies.</li>
      <li>All existing aggregate or de-identified reports, dashboards, exports, and statistics concerning ALPR/LPR scans, alerts, matches, queries, user access, exports, and retention or deletion.</li>
      <li>All annual ALPR/LPR practice and usage reports prepared or submitted under Neb. Rev. Stat. § 60-3206, if applicable.</li>
      <li>Complaints, internal reviews, misuse investigations, corrective-action records, and audit findings concerning ALPR/LPR access, use, or data sharing.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

